<title>POLAND: BYTOM TURNS TO PLN 1.3 MLN LOSS IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>BYTOM TURNS TO PLN 1.3 MLN LOSS IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.26 vs   0.01 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.26 vs   0.06 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.59 vs   0.89 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    8.93 vs   8.73</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net loss		 1.79 vs   0.35 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   1.79 vs   0.69 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.08 vs   2.50 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   22.87 vs  23.14</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Zaklady</p>
<p>Odziezowe Bytom SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
